VALUES ('f67efd8c-178b-406c-879c-65a837f5ccad', '7.40 CT Afghan Lagoon Blue Tourmaline Sugarloaf Cabochon Gemstone', 'Gemstone: Natural Tourmaline
Weight: 7.40 Carats
Cut: Sugarloaf Cabochon
Color: Lagoon Blue / Ocean Blue
Dimensions:10.7x10.7x8.8 mm
Clarity:  natural inclusions
Treatment: None (Untreated)
Origin: Afghanistan

This rare Lagoon Blue Tourmaline displays a calm, ocean-like blue with a subtle green undertone — a color highly admired in Afghan tourmalines. The sugarloaf cabochon cut gives the stone a smooth dome, enhancing its watery depth, soft glow, and natural elegance.

Unlike faceted stones, this cabochon highlights the true body color of the tourmaline, making it ideal for bespoke jewelry, talisman rings, or collector pieces. Afghan blue tourmalines of this size and color are becoming increasingly difficult to source.

✔️ 100% natural
✔️ No heat or treatments
✔️ Ethically sourced
✔️ One-of-a-kind gemstone

Perfect for:
• High-end rings
• Artisan jewelry
• Gem collectors
